{"id":102,"name":"التكاثر","transliteration":"At-Takathur","translation_fr":"La course aux richesses","translation_en":"The Rivalry in world increase","type":"meccan","total_verses":8,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"أَلۡهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","translation_fr":"La course aux richesses vous distrait","translation_en":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you","transliteration":"Alhakumu alttakathuru"},{"id":2,"text":"حَتَّىٰ زُرۡتُمُ ٱلۡمَقَابِرَ","translation_fr":"jusqu'à ce que vous visitiez les tombes","translation_en":"Until you visit the graveyards","transliteration":"Hatta zurtumu almaqabira"},{"id":3,"text":"كَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"Mais non! Vous saurez bientôt","translation_en":"No! You are going to know","transliteration":"Kalla sawfa taAAlamoona"},{"id":4,"text":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"(Encore une fois)! Vous saurez bientôt","translation_en":"Then no! You are going to know","transliteration":"Thumma kalla sawfa taAAlamoona"},{"id":5,"text":"كَلَّا لَوۡ تَعۡلَمُونَ عِلۡمَ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","translation_fr":"Sûrement! Si vous saviez de science certaine","translation_en":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty","transliteration":"Kalla law taAAlamoona AAilma alyaqeeni"},{"id":6,"text":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلۡجَحِيمَ","translation_fr":"Vous verrez, certes, la Fournaise","translation_en":"You will surely see the Hellfire","transliteration":"Latarawunna aljaheema"},{"id":7,"text":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيۡنَ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","translation_fr":"Puis, vous la verrez certes, avec l'œil de la certitude","translation_en":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty","transliteration":"Thumma latarawunnaha AAayna alyaqeeni"},{"id":8,"text":"ثُمَّ لَتُسۡـَٔلُنَّ يَوۡمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","translation_fr":"Puis, assurément, vous serez interrogés, ce jour-là, sur les délices","translation_en":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure","transliteration":"Thumma latusalunna yawmaithin AAani alnnaAAeemi"}]}